{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"af70c97a2f10a408d0142d03e0835c1c27862316a987975ceb152aa1d03b0be9","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"e1177a8f9f689644a232269ab42be3597862f1d26ab23562b7d6171aa6d4faf9","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/lore/shertul.lua:59（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63）描述的是位于水晶都市后方的石质小岛；译文“浮空岛悬浮在周围”遗漏石质属性，并将“behind it”改成“周围”。"},{"revision_key":"e122dd9c588110e524f88fff62fa5c22a25ecd479f49ee7c2fe5fdf14a7ea7d1","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/birth/classes/afflicted.lua:124（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63）并列“在黑暗帷幕后或一群阴影身后发动攻击”；译文改成“操纵阴影，从黑暗中发动攻击”，遗漏两种掩护方式的并列关系并添加操纵含义。"},{"revision_key":"e128c83148dea5452e6b6b00ae7f012edd33d7b5df2e8a7be284e4930a7f56b2","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"译文遗漏“overhealing is not counted”。固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/gifts/fungus.lua:74-79、101-104（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63）以 max_life-self.life 截断实际治疗量后才计算所得能量，故过量治疗不计入回合增益是实际机制。"},{"revision_key":"e172753e04e296ee928a40a0b54f754ad2788f68a8563f03f587fefe0f4a66f1","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e1850836b01cd25004e605aab6d522d0d071a848a3d1ddc11be8508dbb8828f1","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e1884052fcd739907285aff6c5dc71dab76ccba369640aefe7951a978c6d79c7","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"译文把抽象技能范围擅自写成“码”，并把可交换的“creature”缩窄为“怪物”。固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/chronomancy/other.lua:667、670-683（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63）将数值作为 talent range，并直接从 Map.ACTOR 取得目标，未限定敌对怪物。"},{"revision_key":"e1aa8444ae8db89c13258a0c65ad13d6465745a5a5d480222f10e463d655a6ae","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"e1cd6fb504f3f8c421bbdb98148886f74982d2a5c9d5460e47e768a5388dc529","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"固定源码 game/modules/tome/data/lore/misc.lua:80、82（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63）明确写在 Derth 周边遇敌、獠牙长度与剑相当，并以“legends must live on”自我开脱；译文遗漏 Derth，将獠牙改成比剑更长，又改为必须让该生物“繁衍下去”，另添加“赤眼如炙、吞噬周围一切生命”等原文没有的事实。"}]}